  heroSubcopy: 'Beachfront homes, canal properties, hillside estates, and Craftsman bungalows, we know every kind of Ventura home and what its windows need.',
  intro: "Aloha Window Bros cleans windows across the city of Ventura, CA, from beachfront homes in Pierpont and canal homes in Ventura Keys to Midtown Craftsmans and the hillside streets above downtown. Most Ventura homes pay $175 to $425 for the full four-in-one clean (glass inside and out, screens, frames, and sills), with a free on-site quote. Two things dirty Ventura glass faster than inland glass: salt mist and marine layer near the coast, and mineral-heavy water. Ventura uses no imported water at all, and the groundwater share of its supply carries 1,200 to 1,600 mg/L of dissolved solids before the city blends it, so sprinkler overspray leaves visible spots wherever it dries on a window.",
