    { q: 'How much does window cleaning cost in Ventura?', a: 'Most Ventura homes fall between $175 and $425 for a complete residential window cleaning. Larger homes in the Ventura Hillsides or Ondulando, and waterfront homes in Pierpont and Ventura Keys, often run on the higher end. Free on-site estimates, usually within 24 hours.' },
    { q: 'Do you work on waterfront homes in Ventura Keys?', a: 'Yes. Ventura Keys canal-front homes are a regular part of our work. Canal-front glass needs more careful equipment access and benefits from quarterly service because of the heightened humidity and salt exposure.' },
